  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "《资治通鉴》告诉您:人生所有的不幸，都是因\n为你的单纯，不是坏人害你，是你自己太实在#资治通鉴 #历史故事 #人生智慧",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 420.931995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你有没有发现这世上最冤的死法？不是坏人，害你是你自己太实在。资治通鉴写了一千三百六十二年，我翻烂了才看懂一句话，脑子松一扣的人跟脑子紧一扣的人，结局差着十万八千里。今天给您讲两个真人真事，听完您就明白，咱这岁数可以善良，但不能犯犯魂。头一个他唐朝的刘司礼吉州刺史，正儿八经的朝廷大员。有一天，武则天她亲侄子武一宗来了，把他单独叫到后堂门一关压低声音说，刘大人皇上怀疑有人谋反，你帮我个忙，假装跟那几个人串通，再大义灭亲，把他们告了事成保你当宰相讲。刘思理一听，眼睛都亮了，心里头想还有这好事儿，动动嘴皮子就能当宰相。他当天晚上就开始忙活，今天找这个喝酒，明天找那个密谈，回头恭恭敬敬，把名单递上去，脸上笑的跟朵花似的，一口一个。多谢武大人提醒，结果呢无意中接过名单，不急不慢，拿起笔把刘思理的名字也填上去了。第二天上朝，吴一宗往地上一跪，声泪俱下，陛下刘斯理谋反证据确凿。刘思礼站在朝堂上脸刷的就白了，张着嘴，想说，不是您让我干的吗？话到嘴边，硬生生咽回去了，他敢说吗？说了谁信？甚至当天下来斩权族灭，亲戚朋友流放，一千多人押赴。刑场那天，刘斯理一路走，一路念叨，跟魔怔了似的，他说好了的，他说好了的，您说他坏吗？他不坏，他就是太实在了。实在到把官场算计当成了拜把子，把人家一句口头承诺当成了钢刀铁券。他忘了，在利益面前，有些人翻脸比翻书还快。您别觉得这是古代的事儿。现在职场上生意场上，有人跟您说，帮我个忙，亏待不了你，您接不接，咱接着听。第二个，明朝的李擅长，朱元璋打天下的老兄弟开国宰相，七十多岁了，退休在家，儿孙满堂，按说这辈子圆满了。可他有个亲戚叫丁斌，犯了事儿，让朱元璋抓进大牢了。李擅长重感情，心想，我跟陛下出生入死，几十年给亲戚求个情，这个面子总该给吧。他就写了一封奏折，客客气气，陛下丁兵罪不至死，求您开恩。他以为这就是普通的人情往来，可他万万没想到，这封信就是要他全家命的催命符。朱元璋看完冷笑一声，他心里头早就对李善长不放心了。开国功臣威望太高，活着就是一根刺，正愁没借口呢。李善长自己把脖子伸过来了，没多久，青天剑来报，天象有变，诛杀大臣颤。元璋等的就是这句话，当场下旨。李善长全家七十多口全部处死，圣旨送到李府那天，李善长正坐在院子里喝茶，颤巍巍接过圣旨，手抖的茶碗，耳都端不住，旁边儿子嚎啕大哭。爹，您求求陛下。李擅长坐了很久，最后只说了一句，陛下要杀，那就杀吧，他没跑，没闹没申辩，他可能到死都在想，我跟了陛下三十多年，没有功劳，也有苦劳，陛下不会真杀我吧。可现实是，朱元璋从头到尾眼皮都没多眨一下李善长犯的什么病，迷信权威。他以为皇帝说的话就是铁律，自己乖乖听话就能善终。可他忘了制定规则的人，随时可以改规则。听到这儿，您就明白了，单纯不失美德，清醒才是咱这岁数不要求您学算计，但得长个心眼。我从这两个故事里给您提炼出三句话，您记好了。第一，不管面对谁，留个后手再核实一下。甭管对方是领导还是老相识，甭管拿的是红头文件还是口头承诺，您心里的绷一根弦，这事儿有没有可能不对？成年人的体面不在于我听话，而在于我再确认一下不丢人。丢人的是，被坑了之后哭着说，我以为第二，别把别人的承诺当成您的护身符。刘思礼死到临头，还在念叨他说好了的。在任何大事面前，对方的承诺只等于他撕毁承诺的成本，成本够低，他一定会死。别问他，你怎么能这样要问自己，我凭什么信他？第三，遇事先问自己三句话，最坏的结果是什么？我扛得住吗？我现在能做什么？想明白了，再动比闭着眼睛冲上去强一百倍。说到底，资治通鉴写了一千三百六十二年，翻来覆去就是一笔账，脑子勤快的人活，脑子犯懒的人死。真正的成熟，是您看透了人心，能有多黑黑暗才伤不到您。您算清楚了利益背后的账，在利益面前，才不会光着身子被人打。真正的善良，从来不是天真的轻信，是您什么都看透了，依然愿意选择仁慈。这段话建议您点赞、收藏慢慢品。要是觉得在里转发给您那个太实在的老朋友，或者转给孩子，看看咱可以不害人，但不能不防人。关注我，每天给您讲一段历史里的大智慧。嗯，咱们下回见。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 3090,
      "text": "你有没有发现这世上最冤的死法？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3490,
      "end_ms": 4370,
      "text": "不是坏人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4370,
      "end_ms": 6910,
      "text": "害你是你自己太实在。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7970,
      "end_ms": 10550,
      "text": "资治通鉴写了一千三百六十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10870,
      "end_ms": 12950,
      "text": "我翻烂了才看懂一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13450,
      "end_ms": 16590,
      "text": "脑子松一扣的人跟脑子紧一扣的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16810,
      "end_ms": 18710,
      "text": "结局差着十万八千里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18710,
      "end_ms": 20970,
      "text": "今天给您讲两个真人真事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20970,
      "end_ms": 22730,
      "text": "听完您就明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22730,
      "end_ms": 24870,
      "text": "咱这岁数可以善良，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24870,
      "end_ms": 26550,
      "text": "但不能犯犯魂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27750,
      "end_ms": 32500,
      "text": "头一个他唐朝的刘司礼吉州刺史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33500,
      "end_ms": 35560,
      "text": "正儿八经的朝廷大员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36520,
      "end_ms": 37120,
      "text": "有一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38180,
      "end_ms": 41000,
      "text": "武则天她亲侄子武一宗来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 41720,
      "end_ms": 47340,
      "text": "把他单独叫到后堂门一关压低声音说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48860,
      "end_ms": 51840,
      "text": "刘大人皇上怀疑有人谋反，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52200,
      "end_ms": 53220,
      "text": "你帮我个忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 53560,
      "end_ms": 55180,
      "text": "假装跟那几个人串通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55700,
      "end_ms": 56840,
      "text": "再大义灭亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 56840,
      "end_ms": 60255,
      "text": "把他们告了事成保你当宰相讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 60720,
      "end_ms": 61645,
      "text": "刘思理一听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 61970,
      "end_ms": 62975,
      "text": "眼睛都亮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63560,
      "end_ms": 65665,
      "text": "心里头想还有这好事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 66020,
      "end_ms": 68345,
      "text": "动动嘴皮子就能当宰相。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69020,
      "end_ms": 70900,
      "text": "他当天晚上就开始忙活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71020,
      "end_ms": 72140,
      "text": "今天找这个喝酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72260,
      "end_ms": 73495,
      "text": "明天找那个密谈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 73900,
      "end_ms": 75120,
      "text": "回头恭恭敬敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 75120,
      "end_ms": 76325,
      "text": "把名单递上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 76660,
      "end_ms": 78475,
      "text": "脸上笑的跟朵花似的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 78780,
      "end_ms": 79560,
      "text": "一口一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 79680,
      "end_ms": 81165,
      "text": "多谢武大人提醒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 81800,
      "end_ms": 83995,
      "text": "结果呢无意中接过名单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 84310,
      "end_ms": 85025,
      "text": "不急不慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 85330,
      "end_ms": 88275,
      "text": "拿起笔把刘思理的名字也填上去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 89240,
      "end_ms": 90115,
      "text": "第二天上朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 90450,
      "end_ms": 91750,
      "text": "吴一宗往地上一跪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 91990,
      "end_ms": 93105,
      "text": "声泪俱下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 94240,
      "end_ms": 98720,
      "text": "陛下刘斯理谋反证据确凿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 99000,
      "end_ms": 102600,
      "text": "刘思礼站在朝堂上脸刷的就白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 102600,
      "end_ms": 103200,
      "text": "张着嘴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 103200,
      "end_ms": 103660,
      "text": "想说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 103660,
      "end_ms": 104955,
      "text": "不是您让我干的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 105230,
      "end_ms": 106145,
      "text": "话到嘴边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 106480,
      "end_ms": 108085,
      "text": "硬生生咽回去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 108840,
      "end_ms": 109620,
      "text": "他敢说吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 109780,
      "end_ms": 110595,
      "text": "说了谁信？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 111060,
      "end_ms": 113965,
      "text": "甚至当天下来斩权族灭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 114440,
      "end_ms": 116080,
      "text": "亲戚朋友流放，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 116180,
      "end_ms": 117940,
      "text": "一千多人押赴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 117940,
      "end_ms": 118785,
      "text": "刑场那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 119090,
      "end_ms": 120070,
      "text": "刘斯理一路走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 120070,
      "end_ms": 120925,
      "text": "一路念叨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 121160,
      "end_ms": 122335,
      "text": "跟魔怔了似的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 122540,
      "end_ms": 123385,
      "text": "他说好了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 124360,
      "end_ms": 125325,
      "text": "他说好了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 126380,
      "end_ms": 127420,
      "text": "您说他坏吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 127520,
      "end_ms": 128205,
      "text": "他不坏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 129170,
      "end_ms": 130535,
      "text": "他就是太实在了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 130960,
      "end_ms": 133960,
      "text": "实在到把官场算计当成了拜把子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 133980,
      "end_ms": 137595,
      "text": "把人家一句口头承诺当成了钢刀铁券。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 138410,
      "end_ms": 139010,
      "text": "他忘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 139150,
      "end_ms": 140345,
      "text": "在利益面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 140690,
      "end_ms": 143555,
      "text": "有些人翻脸比翻书还快。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 144320,
      "end_ms": 146165,
      "text": "您别觉得这是古代的事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 147200,
      "end_ms": 149510,
      "text": "现在职场上生意场上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 149730,
      "end_ms": 150610,
      "text": "有人跟您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 150610,
      "end_ms": 151270,
      "text": "帮我个忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 151410,
      "end_ms": 152270,
      "text": "亏待不了你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 152310,
      "end_ms": 153075,
      "text": "您接不接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 153560,
      "end_ms": 154260,
      "text": "咱接着听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 154260,
      "end_ms": 154785,
      "text": "第二个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 155500,
      "end_ms": 156680,
      "text": "明朝的李擅长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 156860,
      "end_ms": 159905,
      "text": "朱元璋打天下的老兄弟开国宰相，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 160430,
      "end_ms": 161315,
      "text": "七十多岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 162680,
      "end_ms": 163440,
      "text": "退休在家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 163500,
      "end_ms": 164320,
      "text": "儿孙满堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 164660,
      "end_ms": 166815,
      "text": "按说这辈子圆满了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 167680,
      "end_ms": 169625,
      "text": "可他有个亲戚叫丁斌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 170030,
      "end_ms": 170725,
      "text": "犯了事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 171010,
      "end_ms": 172795,
      "text": "让朱元璋抓进大牢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 173710,
      "end_ms": 175105,
      "text": "李擅长重感情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 175460,
      "end_ms": 175915,
      "text": "心想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 177130,
      "end_ms": 178750,
      "text": "我跟陛下出生入死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 178750,
      "end_ms": 181080,
      "text": "几十年给亲戚求个情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 181380,
      "end_ms": 182760,
      "text": "这个面子总该给吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 183520,
      "end_ms": 184920,
      "text": "他就写了一封奏折，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 185620,
      "end_ms": 186420,
      "text": "客客气气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 187160,
      "end_ms": 190000,
      "text": "陛下丁兵罪不至死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 190780,
      "end_ms": 191740,
      "text": "求您开恩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 192800,
      "end_ms": 195280,
      "text": "他以为这就是普通的人情往来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 195759,
      "end_ms": 196900,
      "text": "可他万万没想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 196900,
      "end_ms": 199700,
      "text": "这封信就是要他全家命的催命符。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 200580,
      "end_ms": 202860,
      "text": "朱元璋看完冷笑一声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 203360,
      "end_ms": 206160,
      "text": "他心里头早就对李善长不放心了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 207000,
      "end_ms": 209455,
      "text": "开国功臣威望太高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 210270,
      "end_ms": 211930,
      "text": "活着就是一根刺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 212390,
      "end_ms": 213730,
      "text": "正愁没借口呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 214630,
      "end_ms": 216790,
      "text": "李善长自己把脖子伸过来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 217610,
      "end_ms": 218270,
      "text": "没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 218590,
      "end_ms": 219650,
      "text": "青天剑来报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 220530,
      "end_ms": 221630,
      "text": "天象有变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 221870,
      "end_ms": 223850,
      "text": "诛杀大臣颤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 223850,
      "end_ms": 225330,
      "text": "元璋等的就是这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 226390,
      "end_ms": 227510,
      "text": "当场下旨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 227970,
      "end_ms": 231630,
      "text": "李善长全家七十多口全部处死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 232270,
      "end_ms": 233950,
      "text": "圣旨送到李府那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 234030,
      "end_ms": 236050,
      "text": "李善长正坐在院子里喝茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 236330,
      "end_ms": 237790,
      "text": "颤巍巍接过圣旨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 238230,
      "end_ms": 239510,
      "text": "手抖的茶碗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 239660,
      "end_ms": 240585,
      "text": "耳都端不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 241360,
      "end_ms": 243145,
      "text": "旁边儿子嚎啕大哭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 244030,
      "end_ms": 244345,
      "text": "爹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 244910,
      "end_ms": 246245,
      "text": "您求求陛下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 248010,
      "end_ms": 249585,
      "text": "李擅长坐了很久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 250040,
      "end_ms": 251215,
      "text": "最后只说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 251470,
      "end_ms": 252270,
      "text": "陛下要杀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 252450,
      "end_ms": 253245,
      "text": "那就杀吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 254240,
      "end_ms": 254975,
      "text": "他没跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 255330,
      "end_ms": 256895,
      "text": "没闹没申辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 257270,
      "end_ms": 258645,
      "text": "他可能到死都在想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 259070,
      "end_ms": 260695,
      "text": "我跟了陛下三十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 261020,
      "end_ms": 261820,
      "text": "没有功劳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 261820,
      "end_ms": 262745,
      "text": "也有苦劳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 263240,
      "end_ms": 264905,
      "text": "陛下不会真杀我吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 265930,
      "end_ms": 266810,
      "text": "可现实是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 266810,
      "end_ms": 272795,
      "text": "朱元璋从头到尾眼皮都没多眨一下李善长犯的什么病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 273380,
      "end_ms": 274475,
      "text": "迷信权威。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 274980,
      "end_ms": 277845,
      "text": "他以为皇帝说的话就是铁律，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 278410,
      "end_ms": 280935,
      "text": "自己乖乖听话就能善终。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 281490,
      "end_ms": 283775,
      "text": "可他忘了制定规则的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 284240,
      "end_ms": 285545,
      "text": "随时可以改规则。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 286450,
      "end_ms": 287150,
      "text": "听到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 287150,
      "end_ms": 288055,
      "text": "您就明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 288880,
      "end_ms": 290215,
      "text": "单纯不失美德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 290860,
      "end_ms": 295945,
      "text": "清醒才是咱这岁数不要求您学算计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 296770,
      "end_ms": 297925,
      "text": "但得长个心眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 299370,
      "end_ms": 303600,
      "text": "我从这两个故事里给您提炼出三句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 303660,
      "end_ms": 304455,
      "text": "您记好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 306030,
      "end_ms": 306490,
      "text": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 306740,
      "end_ms": 307600,
      "text": "不管面对谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 307820,
      "end_ms": 309925,
      "text": "留个后手再核实一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 310740,
      "end_ms": 313095,
      "text": "甭管对方是领导还是老相识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 313490,
      "end_ms": 316085,
      "text": "甭管拿的是红头文件还是口头承诺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 316540,
      "end_ms": 318245,
      "text": "您心里的绷一根弦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 318730,
      "end_ms": 321005,
      "text": "这事儿有没有可能不对？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00148",
      "start_ms": 321710,
      "end_ms": 324430,
      "text": "成年人的体面不在于我听话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00149",
      "start_ms": 324650,
      "end_ms": 328075,
      "text": "而在于我再确认一下不丢人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00150",
      "start_ms": 328450,
      "end_ms": 329130,
      "text": "丢人的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00151",
      "start_ms": 329130,
      "end_ms": 331190,
      "text": "被坑了之后哭着说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00152",
      "start_ms": 331450,
      "end_ms": 332885,
      "text": "我以为第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00153",
      "start_ms": 333160,
      "end_ms": 335965,
      "text": "别把别人的承诺当成您的护身符。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00154",
      "start_ms": 336910,
      "end_ms": 338190,
      "text": "刘思礼死到临头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00155",
      "start_ms": 338310,
      "end_ms": 339885,
      "text": "还在念叨他说好了的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00156",
      "start_ms": 340360,
      "end_ms": 341905,
      "text": "在任何大事面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00157",
      "start_ms": 342430,
      "end_ms": 346535,
      "text": "对方的承诺只等于他撕毁承诺的成本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00158",
      "start_ms": 346990,
      "end_ms": 348025,
      "text": "成本够低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00159",
      "start_ms": 348690,
      "end_ms": 349785,
      "text": "他一定会死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00160",
      "start_ms": 350670,
      "end_ms": 351110,
      "text": "别问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00161",
      "start_ms": 351110,
      "end_ms": 353500,
      "text": "你怎么能这样要问自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00162",
      "start_ms": 353500,
      "end_ms": 354565,
      "text": "我凭什么信他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00163",
      "start_ms": 355650,
      "end_ms": 356090,
      "text": "第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00164",
      "start_ms": 356940,
      "end_ms": 358905,
      "text": "遇事先问自己三句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00165",
      "start_ms": 359850,
      "end_ms": 361410,
      "text": "最坏的结果是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00166",
      "start_ms": 361510,
      "end_ms": 362670,
      "text": "我扛得住吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00167",
      "start_ms": 363150,
      "end_ms": 364590,
      "text": "我现在能做什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00168",
      "start_ms": 365110,
      "end_ms": 365870,
      "text": "想明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00169",
      "start_ms": 365870,
      "end_ms": 369430,
      "text": "再动比闭着眼睛冲上去强一百倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00170",
      "start_ms": 369910,
      "end_ms": 370570,
      "text": "说到底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00171",
      "start_ms": 370670,
      "end_ms": 373330,
      "text": "资治通鉴写了一千三百六十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00172",
      "start_ms": 373690,
      "end_ms": 375889,
      "text": "翻来覆去就是一笔账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00173",
      "start_ms": 376790,
      "end_ms": 378290,
      "text": "脑子勤快的人活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00174",
      "start_ms": 378770,
      "end_ms": 380270,
      "text": "脑子犯懒的人死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00175",
      "start_ms": 381070,
      "end_ms": 382310,
      "text": "真正的成熟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00176",
      "start_ms": 382830,
      "end_ms": 384330,
      "text": "是您看透了人心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00177",
      "start_ms": 384410,
      "end_ms": 386970,
      "text": "能有多黑黑暗才伤不到您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00178",
      "start_ms": 387310,
      "end_ms": 389335,
      "text": "您算清楚了利益背后的账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00179",
      "start_ms": 389990,
      "end_ms": 391050,
      "text": "在利益面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00180",
      "start_ms": 391450,
      "end_ms": 393390,
      "text": "才不会光着身子被人打。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00181",
      "start_ms": 393890,
      "end_ms": 395010,
      "text": "真正的善良，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00182",
      "start_ms": 395510,
      "end_ms": 397470,
      "text": "从来不是天真的轻信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00183",
      "start_ms": 397850,
      "end_ms": 399430,
      "text": "是您什么都看透了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00184",
      "start_ms": 400070,
      "end_ms": 402070,
      "text": "依然愿意选择仁慈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00185",
      "start_ms": 402270,
      "end_ms": 406210,
      "text": "这段话建议您点赞、收藏慢慢品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00186",
      "start_ms": 406690,
      "end_ms": 410390,
      "text": "要是觉得在里转发给您那个太实在的老朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00187",
      "start_ms": 410750,
      "end_ms": 411870,
      "text": "或者转给孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00188",
      "start_ms": 411870,
      "end_ms": 413850,
      "text": "看看咱可以不害人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00189",
      "start_ms": 414250,
      "end_ms": 415530,
      "text": "但不能不防人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00190",
      "start_ms": 416070,
      "end_ms": 416670,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00191",
      "start_ms": 416870,
      "end_ms": 419605,
      "text": "每天给您讲一段历史里的大智慧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00192",
      "start_ms": 419800,
      "end_ms": 420010,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7e9d12d17d945cb4_s00193",
      "start_ms": 420050,
      "end_ms": 420795,
      "text": "咱们下回见。"
    }
  ],
